  "citation": "Chen X; Puttu U; Xu L; Wang J (2025): CROCUS Air Quality Dataset from the University of Illinois Chicago (UIC), July 2024. Community Research on Climate and Urban Science Urban Integrated Field Laboratory (CROCUS UIFL). Dataset. doi:10.15485/2547039",
  "dataset": {
