    "measurementTechnique": [
      "This measurement was conducted in an environment-controlled laboratory at UIC, with several measures taken to ensure optimal sampling conditions. These included the use of a heat pump at the inlet and aluminum tape wrapped around the sampling line to control the humidity of the airflow and prevent condensation. A mast over 7 meters tall was set up as the inlet system above the building roof to minimize contamination from building exhaust. The robust instrument setup and secure connections ensured high-quality measurements.",
      "Each instrument underwent detailed calibration before and after the IOP, with corresponding corrections applied to each dataset. For particle size distribution measured by the SMPS, additional particle loss efficiency corrections were applied based on the whole system setup."
    ],
